# Copy to .env and fill in. Loaded by app/config.py on startup; a real shell
# env var always overrides whatever's set here. Never commit .env itself
# (gitignored) — this file is the template.

# Required — your Obsidian vault (absolute path).
VAULT_PATH=/absolute/path/to/your/vault

# Optional — app.db/index.db location. Default: backend/data.
# DASHBOARD_DATA_DIR=

# Optional — background provider refresh cadence, seconds. Default: 300.
# PROVIDER_REFRESH_SECONDS=

# Optional — must match uvicorn's --port (baked into OAuth redirect URIs). Default: 8788.
# BACKEND_PORT=

# Optional — home coordinate, used as the weather/§14 origin until §10 has a
# recent location fix. Default: the centre of the contiguous US (a placeholder).
# HOME_LAT=
# HOME_LON=

# Optional — Claude Code CLI model aliases for background summarizers.
# EMAIL_SUMMARY_MODEL=haiku
# BRIEF_MODEL=sonnet
# EXTRACT_MODEL=haiku

# Optional (§8 genres) — last.fm/api/account/create. Free, no OAuth, no secret.
# Supplies per-artist genre/mood tags, which Spotify's API no longer returns at
# all. Unset = the lastfm provider reports "off" and never calls out; every
# other Spotify feature (plays, listen_min, novelty) works without it.
# LASTFM_API_KEY=
# Artists enriched per poll cycle, most-played first. Default: 25.
# LASTFM_ENRICH_PER_CYCLE=25

# Optional (§16 flights) — flightaware.com/aeroapi key, Personal tier. Only
# needed for live flight-status polling / gate-change notifications; trip
# extraction from email works without it.
# AEROAPI_KEY=

# Optional (§14 time-to-leave) — Google Cloud API key with the Routes API and
# Geocoding API enabled (Maps Platform free tier covers solo use easily).
# Powers the traffic-aware "leave by H:MM" leave times; without it /api/leave
# still lists located events, just with leave_by null. LEAVE_BUFFER_MIN is the
# padding (minutes) subtracted on top of drive time. Default: 10.
# LEAVE_GEOCODE_CONTEXT is appended to an event location that geocodes to
# nothing on its own, which is then retried once — a school calendar often
# writes a room bare ("KDC 240"), and only the campus attached resolves it.
# Empty (the default) means no retry.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
# LEAVE_BUFFER_MIN=10
# LEAVE_GEOCODE_CONTEXT=Example University, Springfield, IL

# Optional — your own phone numbers / iCloud emails, comma-separated. A text
# you send yourself is routed to a task/event/note (app/selftexts.py). Empty =
# self-text routing off.
# MESSAGES_SELF_HANDLES=+15551234567,me@icloud.com

# Coursework provider: your Brightspace calendar feed (Brightspace → Calendar
# → Subscribe). The URL embeds a personal token — treat it as a secret.
# BRIGHTSPACE_ICS_URL=https://brightspace.usc.edu/d2l/le/calendar/feed/user/feed.ics?token=...

# §10 (location) — the relay the phone posts to (relay/, README → Location
# ingest). URL = the Worker's workers.dev origin; TOKEN = its PULL_TOKEN.
# LOCATION_RELAY_URL=
# LOCATION_RELAY_TOKEN=

# Optional — auto exercise check-in. On each health refresh, a day whose Active
# Zone Minutes reach the threshold auto-checks the named habit (never overwrites
# a manual check/un-check). Set threshold to 0 to disable. Default: Exercise, 30.
# EXERCISE_HABIT_NAME=Exercise
# EXERCISE_AZM_THRESHOLD=30

# Optional — auto sleep check-in. A night whose sleep_hours reach the threshold
# (keyed on the wake-up day) auto-checks the named habit, same rules as above.
# Set threshold to 0 to disable. Default: Sleep, 9.
# SLEEP_HABIT_NAME=Sleep
# SLEEP_HOURS_THRESHOLD=9

# Optional — console (embedded Claude Code chat) knobs.
# CONSOLE_PERMISSION_MODE=acceptEdits
# CONSOLE_MODEL=sonnet
